<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We always want for your journey to be as simple and seamless as possible, so I’m sorry to hear about your experience on arrival in to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} and the &lt;<em><strong>confiscation of/damage to</strong></em>&gt; of your &lt;<em><strong>Lost Property Name</strong></em>&gt;.<br />
<br />
We go to great lengths to look after our customers’ property while it is in our care, but our responsibility doesn’t extend to anything &lt;<em><strong>confiscated/damaged</strong></em>&gt; at a security screening checkpoint.<br />
<br />
<strong>Contact the airport directly</strong><br />
<br />
You’ll need to contact the Airport Authority in {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}} directly to follow this up. I understand it’s upsetting to have this happen, so I hope the above information helps. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
We look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
